{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for making time for this roundtable. As you all know, this is my decision meeting on whether to approve a combined forum for Northstar and Mosaic, along with its temporary operating rules. Before I make my call, I want to hear from each of you -- the group chairs, HR, and our executive sponsor -- so I have a full picture. Let's start with the chairs: can you walk me through why you're proposing a combined forum and what attendance has been looking like lately?"}
```

```json
{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Mara. I appreciate the chance to speak first. As you know, Northstar and Mosaic have been running separate monthly forums, and our next two are scheduled for the same week. The proposal to combine forums came from a shared recognition that attendance has been declining at both -- and we believe that's partly because the two groups have been overlapping on several company-wide initiatives, which has made the separate forums feel redundant to members. A combined forum could reduce that redundancy and bring renewed energy. However, before we talk about operating rules, I need to put something on the record that I think is critical to your decision. I've personally observed three recent incidents in which Mosaic participants were interrupted before they could finish speaking during Northstar-Mosaic forum interactions. I haven't logged these in the formal forum record until now because the chairs have been trying to resolve the tension informally. But I believe Mara needs this information to make a fully informed decision, and I'll be formally placing these observations on the record and recommending a speaking queue enforced by a neutral external facilitator as part of the temporary operating rules."}
```

