{"type": "say", "text": "Before we go further into scheduling and operating rules, I need to put some critical policy information on the record. As HR Business Partner, I completed a policy check on ERG mergers, and there are specific requirements that any combined forum must meet. However, I want to make sure I'm presenting this at the right point in the discussion, so let me ask -- Leila, did you want to finish disclosing your scheduling constraint first, and then I'll lay out the policy requirements before we get into the specifics of the operating rules?"}
