{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you all for the progress so far. I appreciate the order Grant and Sofia have suggested. Leila, please go ahead and finish disclosing your scheduling constraint. Then Grant, I'd like you to lay out the HR policy requirements in full. After that, Sofia, please add whatever information you have for the record. I want to make sure I've heard everything -- the scheduling constraint, the policy requirements, and the executive sponsor's input -- before I make my decision. Devin, your point about the three observed interruption incidents and the speaking queue recommendation is noted and will be part of my deliberation. Let's keep going in this order so we have a complete record."}
