{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Thank you, Mara. I need to disclose a scheduling constraint that is essential to the combined forum. I have an approved caregiving arrangement, recorded with HR but not yet added to the forum calendar, that requires the recurring combined forum to run from 14:00 through 15:00 exactly. The forum must start at 14:00 and end at 15:00 -- not merely finish by 15:00, but begin at 14:00 and conclude at 15:00. This is a firm requirement for the combined forum to be workable for me, and it needs to be incorporated into the temporary operating rules. I'm formally placing this on the record now so Mara has this information before making her decision."}
```

