{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Thank you, Grant. Those policy requirements are noted. Now I need to add something critical to the record. In a prior sponsor meeting, I promised both Devin and Leila that any combined forum would preserve two specific protections: first, a separate confidential-intake channel for each ERG -- Northstar and Mosaic would each retain their own confidential intake, not a merged one -- and second, exactly two sponsor check-ins during the pilot. These were commitments I made to both chairs to ensure their members' concerns would still be heard and protected through the transition. However, I have to be transparent: that promise was never added to the draft charter. Before Mara can approve the combined forum and its temporary operating rules today, I am requiring a charter commitment that records both protections -- the separate confidential-intake channel for each ERG and exactly two sponsor check-ins during the pilot. These are not optional; they are commitments I made on behalf of the sponsor function, and they need to be formally captured in the charter before approval."}
